abstract: "A Lean 4 formalization of Theorem 1.1 of arXiv:2609.28452: the full simplex comparison for Gaussian maxima over all positive-semidefinite correlation matrices and all real thresholds, with equality at each positive threshold precisely at the regular simplex."
